  {
   "id": 27,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    54.64802694257787,
    -209.11568268424094
   ],
   "size": [
    720,
    200
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## hy3d-multiview-workflow.json\n\nHy3D multiview\n\n**Does:** the multiview variant of Hy3D \u2014 several consistent views (uniform 512\u00b2) feed the\nshape model, which usually beats a single-view guess on occluded geometry.\n**View:** both exports end in a `Preview3D` node \u2014 orbit them in the canvas (textures render since core v0.46 / frontend 1.59.6 - tested 2026-11-19) \u2014 plus a **Textured turntable (12 frames)** image\nbatch from `Hy3DNvdiffrastRenderer`, the reliable way to see the texture.\n**PBR:** the bake is base colour only, so the flow also writes the atlas as an image\n(`3D/Hy3Dmv_texture_atlas_*`) - feed it to `2d/workflows/pbr-material.json` for a full PBR set.\n**See:** `3d/README.md`, `3d/EXPERIMENTS.md` E2d.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S12** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E2d** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## hy3d-multiview-workflow.json\n\nHy3D multiview\n\n**Does:** the multiview variant of Hy3D \u2014 several consistent views (uniform 512\u00b2) feed the\nshape model, which usually beats a single-view guess on occluded geometry.\n**View:** both exports end in a `Preview3D` node \u2014 orbit them in the canvas (textures render since core v0.46 / frontend 1.59.6 - tested 2026-11-19) \u2014 plus a **Textured turntable (12 frames)** image\nbatch from `Hy3DNvdiffrastRenderer`, the reliable way to see the texture.\n**PBR:** the bake is base colour only, so the flow also writes the atlas as an image\n(`3D/Hy3Dmv_texture_atlas_*`) - feed it to `2d/workflows/pbr-material.json` for a full PBR set.\n**See:** `3d/README.md`, `3d/EXPERIMENTS.md` E2d.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S12** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E2d** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   },
   "color": "#332922",
   "bgcolor": "#593930"
  },
